## Skills & Design Corpus

Check available skills before non-trivial work — many auto-activate for relevant tasks (systematic-debugging, test-driven-development, design-corpus, intake, etc.). The design corpus at `~/.claude/corpus/` captures preferred patterns across all projects; consult it for architectural decisions and implementation conventions.

